WEBVTT

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:37.310
I guess we should have taken the
other road, back at that fork.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:39.150
We'll be sleeping outside if
we don't find a place soon.

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:43.180
Rin Rin, we followed your fortune
and look what happened.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:45.770
It was completely useless.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.450
What's wrong, Rin Rin?

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.250
My stomach hurts.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:56.770
I told you to use the bathroom
before we left the tea house.

00:01:56.770 --> 00:02:02.760
No... It just hurts really bad.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:03.590
Hey!

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:05.800
Rin Rin!

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:07.000
Rin Rin-chan!

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:09.800
Hang on!

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:15.960
<b>Episode 5
Kakuka and Teiiku
Come Into Sousou's Service</b>

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.900
Excuse us!

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:25.860
One of our companions has fallen ill.
Would you let her rest by your fire?

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:28.030
What? Ill?

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:30.620
Let me take a look at her.

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:33.660
Don't worry. I'm a doctor.

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.300
Does it hurt here?

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:43.130
No.

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:45.030
What did you eat for lunch?

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:51.770
I had some eel and rice, and at the teahouse
back there, I had a big melon.

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:53.650
Here?

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.960
What are you doing?

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:03.830
Striking at the root of her illness by piercing her
with needles and sending ki through them!

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:11.230
My soul and my needles are one!

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:13.700
This is my full power!

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.530
Destroy the demons of illness!

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:17.300
<i>Become healthy!</i>

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:31.140
<i>Demons begone!</i>

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:42.840
H-Huh?

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:45.360
My stomach doesn't hurt anymore?

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:48.540
A-Are you really OK?

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.370
It pricked for a second,
felt funny for a second,

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.320
and then suddenly stopped hurting!

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:56.020
My guess is that you consumed
a bad combination,

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:57.720
and it made your stomach convulse.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:01.410
If it doesn't hurt anymore,
then you'll be fine.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:07.600
I apologize. Not only have we intruded on your evening,
but you've been kind enough to help us.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:11.760
Don't worry about it. A doctor's
role in life is to heal patients.

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:12.730
There's no need to thank me.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.340
Oh! I'm sorry I forgot to mention it
earlier, my name is Kan'u.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:19.000
I'm Rin Rin. Thanks for healing me!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.810
These are our fellow travelers,
Koumei and Ryuubi-dono.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:23.860
I'm Shokatsu Koumei.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.380
Ryuu Gentoku.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:29.600
And last is myself, Chou Shiryuu of Jouzan.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:31.160
My name is Kada.

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:32.610
I'm a traveling doctor.

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:34.410
Kada?

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:36.680
Of the Way of the Five Grains...

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.630
<i>No!</i>

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.460
It's the <i>Way of the Five Grains!</i>

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:52.440
It's important to give it the
appropriate emphasis.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.620
U-Uh, I'll remember that.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:05:01.000
So, Shuri, what is this Way... I mean,
<i>Way of the Five Grains</i>?

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.660
Right, the <i>Way of the Five Grains</i>

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:07.780
is a type of Taoism prominent
in the Kanchuu region.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:13.690
Practitioners are known for aiding
the poor and healing the sick.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:20.600
From what I've heard, Kada-san is one of the best
doctors of the <i>Way of the Five Grains</i>!

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:25.410
I see. So he's a famous doctor of the
<i>Way of the Five Grains</i>!

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:29.830
Yes. A famous doctor of the <i>Way
of the Five Grains</i>!

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:33.400
The most famous doctor of the <i>Way
of the Five Grains</i>? That's amazing.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:35.630
<i>Way of the Five Grains!</i>

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.050
<i>Way of the Five Grains!</i>

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:39.590
You guys are having fun
with that, aren't you?

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:42.430
Yes! That's how you say it.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.510
The <i>Crucial Keys to
the Way of Peace</i>?

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:50.500
Yes. The order has asked that I
find this book and seal it away.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.560
The <i>Crucial Keys to the Way of Peace
</i>is not just a book of magic spells.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:57.040
It contains magic energy itself.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.160
It contains magic energy?

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:04.110
In magic, even if a caster knows
how to perform a spell,

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:09.370
if they lack the required power, or
magical energy, they can't use it.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:13.500
In the same way that in martial arts,
even if someone knows a form,

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:17.800
if they lack the stamina or physical
training for it, it's useless.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:20.490
Yes. That's about right.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:24.920
But the <i>Crucial Keys </i>contains
its own energy.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:30.580
Therefore, anyone with the slightest talent for
magic can use it to perform many spells.

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:36.320
And fueling this magical energy are the land's
oppressed people's cries of hatred.

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:41.530
For there is no stronger power than that which, hating
our fallen world, calls for peace to return to the land.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:48.290
Um, I don't know much about magic,
but is that a bad thing?

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:55.760
If it uses the people's hatred of oppression,
couldn't that be used to make the world better?

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.480
That's true.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:02.790
The book was originally created
for that purpose,

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:06.650
to use the energy to save suffering people.

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:13.180
But eventually, it appeared that
the book had its own will,

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:16.990
like it was trying to gather its own energy.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.780
It seems that the <i>Crucial
Keys</i> draws out

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:24.660
the evil desires hidden in its bearer's heart,

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:27.710
using the bearer to plunge the
world into further chaos.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:37.730
I see. So the people's hatred grows,
and thus, it can hold more power.

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:39.770
How awful!

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:43.140
And so, you think it's around here?

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:49.090
Actually, I heard that Sousou is secretly
searching for the <i>Crucial Keys</i>.

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:50.440
Sousou-dono is?

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:56.330
If she already has it, I must speak to her
and ask her to let me seal it away.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:00.770
If she won't, I must explain its dangers,
so she will relinquish it.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:03.710
What's wrong, Kan'u-dono?

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:07.390
Well, I know her.

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:12.620
She doesn't seem like the kind of person
who would rely on such a book.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:13.880
I see.

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:17.510
Then there may be some deeper reason...

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:25.640
Let's spread our wings and flutter away,
and awaken from the dream of a thousand years.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:28.300
Rin Rin-chan is doing great.

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:31.200
You'd never think she was sick yesterday.

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.110
Kids should always be energetic.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.980
I'm sure her mother feels better now, too.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.040
Mother?

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.880
Am I wrong?

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:42.830
Y-Yes.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:46.350
Rin Rin has sworn a bond
of sisterhood with me!

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:50.970
Actually, I've never even done anything
that could lead to a kid...

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:55.170
Oh, no!

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.460
Someone's collapsed over there!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:06.660
Is she breathing?

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:08.350
Or...

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:10.490
Kada-dono? Well?

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.580
She's completely healthy!

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:20.070
Th-Then what's all that blood?

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:21.830
It's OK.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.060
It's just a nosebleed.

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:28.380
Nothing to worry about.

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:33.730
I-chan, I wet a towel in the river nearby.

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:37.180
Sit up and let's wipe your face, OK?

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:39.920
But a nosebleed...

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:42.120
That pool of blood...

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:48.750
I'm sorry for that embarrassing scene.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.480
I was so surprised, I thought my
bellybutton would jump out!

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:54.890
My name is Kakuka. My
style name is Houkou.

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:57.310
This is my traveling companion.

00:09:57.310 --> 00:09:59.010
I am Teiiku.

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:01.190
I'm Houkei.

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:02.500
Hi, everyone.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.610
Hi!

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:09.000
What's wrong, Houkei?

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:14.630
Nothing. I was just a bit surprised that
she responded normally to a doll.

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:17.470
Wow! The doll talks!

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:21.480
I knew it! I was supposed to make
a sarcastic remark back there.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:24.270
Actually, Fuu here and I

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:29.560
are going to Sousou-sama's palace to
seek employment as strategists.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.760
I see. You're going to Sousou-dono's place.

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:35.230
You see, Fuu and I have read

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:41.030
many books of strategy, like Sun Tzu's <i>Art of War</i>,
and have learned the martial ways, both old and new!

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:44.270
So we're searching for a master who shares
our beliefs, to bring peace to the land.

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:48.240
On our journey, we heard of
Sousou-sama and felt that she,

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:53.440
<b>Talented Ruler in Peacetime</b>

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:51.240
known as a talented ruler in peacetime
and a deadly fighter in wartime,

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:53.440
<b>Deadly Fighter in Wartime</b>

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:56.240
is what the world truly
needs right now!

00:10:56.770 --> 00:11:01.690
As you can see, she's a really
big fan of Sousou-san.

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:05.190
I'm not really a fan...

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:07.730
But you do like her.

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:12.590
I haven't even met her. I can't really say
I like her, so much as I admire her...

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:18.450
If possible, you wish to serve beside her
as a strategist and offer yourself to her.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:23.010
I couldn't do something so bold
as offering myself to her.

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:26.150
B-But if I really did...

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:30.740
Oh, no!

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:34.640
I'm going to serve as a strategist,
not as <i>that</i>.

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:40.290
Y-Yes, I did say I'd offer myself up,
body and soul, but I didn't really mean...

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:43.160
Oh, so forceful!

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:47.840
B-But that rough way you're using
your fingers drives me crazy...

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:52.010
She seems to be in the grip
of a rather violent fantasy.

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:54.310
Should we do something?

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:58.390
If she keeps that up, I suspect someone important
will get mad at her eventually...

00:11:58.390 --> 00:12:00.680
No, not there!

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:15.040
I've embarrassed myself again. I'm sorry.

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:19.290
No, this solves the mystery of that pool
of blood we found you lying in.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.930
P-Putting that aside,

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:27.300
if you're that passionate, Sousou-dono is always
interested in hiring talented people.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:30.730
I'm sure she would accept your request.

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:35.730
Judging from your comments,
you know her?

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:38.060
Not only does she know her,

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:42.990
Sousou has personally rubbed her glossy,
luscious hair down there...

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.080
Hey, Sei!

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:48.440
G-G-Glossy, luscious hair down there...

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:55.180
I-chan, let's calm down, OK?

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:57.000
Calm down...

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:04.650
Either way, we were lucky to run
into acquaintances of hers here.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:09.580
If you wouldn't mind, could
you introduce us to her?

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:15.680
Well, we're both going the
same way, so I don't mind.

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:17.350
What do you think, Ryuubi-dono?

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:20.110
It's all right with me.

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:23.810
OK. Thanks, guys.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:33.380
What a lively town!

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:37.510
I'm sure Sousou-san's rule is going well.

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:44.180
I'm going straight to Sousou-san's place.
Would you like to come with me?

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:45.770
Oh, that's a fine idea...

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:48.540
Um... You know, they say you can't
fight on an empty stomach.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:51.150
I'd like to get something to eat first.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:54.060
Sure you would...

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:57.060
You've gotten scared, haven't you?

00:13:57.060 --> 00:14:02.970
Hey, Houkei, when you see something that obvious,
you're not supposed to say anything.

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:07.390
Then let's get something to eat first.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:10.580
Kada-dono, see you later.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:11.560
OK.

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:12.650
Goodbye, then.

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:17.450
The food's here.

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:20.020
Yummy!

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:21.920
Let's eat!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:27.960
This maboudoufu is good!

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.630
This meat is good, too!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:31.980
This is mutton, isn't it?

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:33.720
These bamboo shoots are also good.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:36.440
Me! Give me some!

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:38.990
Houkei, you eat the candy.

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:42.600
Hey, don't blame me if you
get a stomachache again.

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:50.860
Then I'll have old Mr. Kada do the pinch,
"huh?", "wow!" thing again, so it's fine.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.360
Old...

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:55.480
He'd get depressed if he heard that.

00:14:58.450 --> 00:14:59.510
Sorry.

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:02.640
Anyway, that's how it is.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:05.490
I'm surprised.

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:08.830
I had no idea the <i>Crucial Keys
</i>was such a dangerous book.

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:10.740
All right, Kada.

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:13.060
I'll stop looking for it.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:19.260
OK. But why were you looking
for it in the first place?

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:24.350
Kan'u-dono said that you weren't the
type of person to rely on magic.

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:26.180
You met Kan'u?

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:29.440
Yeah, I met her in my travels.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.640
She should be coming here sometime.

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:34.400
I see... That'll be fun.

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:37.270
By the way, what about my question?

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:42.080
Actually, I haven't been feeling well lately.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:50.540
I've tried a lot of medicines, but none of them
have worked. And so, as a last hope...

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:53.550
You decided to try magic?

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:54.770
Yes.

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:59.070
But you don't seem to be in the
grips of some terrible disease.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.020
I-It's not happening.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.610
Huh? What isn't?

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:06.760
It!

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:09.770
It's not happening?

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:13.570
Don't worry. That's not a disease.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.010
Actually, it's a good thing-

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:16.200
No!

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:20.990
I only allow women in my bed.
How could I be pregnant?

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:23.960
That's not what I meant...

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.420
Then what?

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.220
I'm a doctor.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:29.550
Don't be embarrassed. Tell me.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:32.630
So, um... I...

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:33.900
Number two...

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:36.050
Oh, you're constipated!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.720
Don't shout about it!

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:42.000
But still, you're treating
it like a really big deal.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:46.290
I said, don't shout about it!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.420
It hasn't happened in a month,

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:51.080
so I can't eat, my skin's getting rough,

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:54.280
and above all, it makes me cranky
and unable to concentrate!

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.660
I see. It sounds pretty bad, then.

00:16:57.100 --> 00:17:01.590
I could just chop open your stomach
and squeeze it all out.

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:03.240
Don't be stupid!

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:05.080
If you cut open my stomach, I'll die!

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:07.250
Don't worry.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:10.580
If we use the medicine I created
called "mafutsusan,"

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:15.470
you'll fall asleep in an instant and feel no pain,
no matter what I do during that time.

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:19.680
And once we're done and I sew it up, there won't
be any serious scarring, either. So don't worry!

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:23.450
It really will work, won't it?

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:28.110
Of course it will.

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:30.990
Hey, what was that pause right there?!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:35.100
If you're worried about me opening your
stomach, I can use needles instead.

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:39.110
Oh, so there are sensible ways of doing it.

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:40.370
How does that work?

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:45.050
First, you rub the *** to increase the blood
flow, then stick a needle in the ***.

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:47.680
Then you vibrate that needle
to stimulate the area.

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:52.390
Then you *** the ***, then *** the ***,
and since you're ***ing the ***...

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:58.310
Finally, you insert this golden needle
to channel ki through it.

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:02.290
<i>Like hell I'm doing that!</i>

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:08.640
H-Hey, wait!

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:13.070
It's medicine. I don't have
some weird fetish here...

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.180
Karin-sama, what's going on?

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:18.700
Shunran, capture him and cut off his head!

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:20.650
Immediately!

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:24.610
Don't let him get away!

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:28.310
Jeez! What was with that quack?

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:29.350
Karin-sama.

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:30.210
What is it?

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:34.440
Kan'u has asked for an audience.
What shall I do?

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:36.270
Kan'u did?

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:40.550
She says there is someone she'd
like considered to be an officer.

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:43.780
All right. Bring them to the audience
chamber immediately.

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:44.540
Yes.

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.280
No, wait.

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.480
I just had a good idea.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:18:59.930
It's been a long time, Kan'u.

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:02.120
S-Sousou-dono...

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:04.600
Why are you meeting us here?

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:08.380
Those are the two who
wish to serve me, yes?

00:19:08.860 --> 00:19:14.210
Th-Thank you for allowing us an audience.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.290
I-I am Kakuka!

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:17.710
I am Teiiku.

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:25.580
Kan'u, by meeting them here, without
a single shred of clothing on them,

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:29.610
I can judge their true character,
free of the influence of finery.

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:31.260
I-I see...

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:34.820
Now... You join me in the bath, too.

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:36.360
OK.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:37.660
Wait!

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:42.800
It's simple etiquette to not take
a towel with you into the bath.

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:44.580
But...

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.920
If you can't be polite, then
we're done here.

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:49.850
No way.

00:20:04.110 --> 00:20:07.450
Th-This is Sousou-sama in the flesh.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:10.410
She's more beautiful than I'd imagined!

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:15.140
My glasses are clouded by the steam,
but if I could see her naked...

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:18.600
No. My nose is going to bleed again.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:22.330
Now then, let's begin with Teiiku.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.530
Yes.

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:26.360
What do you think of the current
state of the land?

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:32.530
The great tree, which once filled the sky,
has now begun to rot at its roots.

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:37.110
Rather than simply aiming for the sky by climbing
a tree that has started to wither,

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:43.060
I believe now is the time to endure the
cold winter and gather strength,

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:46.050
waiting for the time of blossoming.

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:53.020
And, in place of the old tree that will someday
collapse, become a new tree myself, right?

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:59.790
And your name was...

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:02.370
K-K-K-Kakuka!

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:06.900
What are your thoughts about
the path I should take?

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:10.400
Well?

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:17.750
I-I-I believe that you should...

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:26.550
This is...

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.870
This sensation...

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:47.640
My, my...

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:49.200
That was awful.

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:51.050
Kan'u.

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:53.070
You saved me again.

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:57.770
I would prefer that you thank Kakuka-dono
instead of myself.

00:21:57.770 --> 00:22:01.530
But it seems that you, as usual,
have many enemies.

00:22:02.030 --> 00:22:03.580
It can't be helped.

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:11.150
The world's wrong now. If you do what's right, those who
can't appreciate it will naturally come after you.

00:22:12.780 --> 00:22:18.510
Now then, Teiiku, you seem
worthy to join me.

00:22:18.510 --> 00:22:21.980
Will you serve as my strategist?

00:22:23.170 --> 00:22:24.980
As you wish.

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:26.250
Kakuka.

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:31.830
Your skill of blinding the enemy with
your nosebleed was splendid.

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:34.180
No, that was...

00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:40.670
I'd like you to continue using that skill in my defense,
as a member of my personal bodyguard.

00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:43.420
Bodyguard...

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:48.340
Not a strategist. A bodyguard?

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:50.430
I'm counting on you.

00:24:26.290 --> 00:24:28.440
Kakuka, that fly is annoying me.

00:24:28.440 --> 00:24:29.650
Knock it down with your nosebleed.

00:24:29.650 --> 00:24:31.010
Yes, immediately!

00:24:31.530 --> 00:24:34.540
Kakuka, I'm using my stamp.
Give me something to use instead of ink.

00:24:34.540 --> 00:24:35.650
Yes, immediately!

00:24:36.530 --> 00:24:39.200
Kakuka, the paint on the loft is peeling.

00:24:39.200 --> 00:24:40.300
Yes, immediately!

00:24:41.920 --> 00:24:44.280
Kakuka, do the preview.

00:24:44.280 --> 00:24:47.160
Next time on <i>Shin Koihime
Musou,</i> Episode 6:

00:24:47.160 --> 00:24:50.500
Ten'i is tested by Sousou.

00:24:50.300 --> 00:24:55.090
<b>Episode 6
Ten'i
Is Tested
by Sousou</b>

00:24:51.130 --> 00:24:55.080
I really wanna be a strategist!

00:24:55.090 --> 00:25:00.050
<b>Watch us again, OK?
And rewatch this episode!</b>
